<title>USA: Piedmont Power, S.C., repriced, top yld 6.641 pct.</title>
<headline>Piedmont Power, S.C., repriced, top yld 6.641 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan Securities Inc said Thursday it repriced Piedmont Municipal Power Agency, S.C., bonds, lowering yields in both maturities and cutting the top yield in 2021 to approximately 6.641 percent from approximately 6.691 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>PIEDMONT MUNICIPAL POWER AGENCY</p>
<p>RE: $163,110,000*</p>
<p>(SOUTH CAROLINA)</p>
<p>ELECTRIC REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>1996A REFUNDING SERIES</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD RECEIVED</p>
<p>  MOODY'S: Baa1		  S&amp;P: BBB		   FITCH: BBB</p>
<p>  DATED: 09/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 01/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 01/01</p>
<p>MATURITY		 AMOUNT*    COUPON	  PRICE</p>
<p>01/01/2016	     84,010M    6.55  %	 99.625</p>
<p>						    (Approx. Yield 6.583)</p>
<p>01/01/2021	     79,100M    6.60  %	 99.50</p>
<p>						    (Approx. Yield 6.641)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 01/01/1998    100.00</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Friday, September 6, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on September 25, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry.  DTC is pending.</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>Interstate/Johnson Lane Corporation</p>
<p>J.C. Bradford &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
